WEBVTT

00:02:09.760 --> 00:02:12.680
I'm afraid of Misato and Rei.

00:02:12.680 --> 00:02:17.600
Help me.

00:02:17.600 --> 00:02:25.050
Please, get up.

00:02:25.050 --> 00:02:29.380
Please, wake up, let's go!

00:02:30.730 --> 00:02:32.560
Please! Please!

00:02:33.140 --> 00:02:37.380
Disgusting! Disgusting! Disgusting! Disgusting!

00:03:46.540 --> 00:03:47.480
I love you so much.

00:03:47.480 --> 00:03:55.250
What will the headquarters do, General?

00:03:55.250 --> 00:03:57.750
Your security plan entered into alert condition, right?

00:03:57.750 --> 00:03:59.830
Why do they do it? That kid...

00:04:00.320 --> 00:04:01.290
The last angel?

00:04:01.290 --> 00:04:04.320
Yes, we're supposed to finish all the angels.

00:04:04.320 --> 00:04:06.850
I thought we'd have peace and prosperity.

00:04:06.850 --> 00:04:09.530
What will happen to the headquarters and the Evas?

00:04:09.530 --> 00:04:11.600
Dr. Akagi hasn't returned.

00:04:11.600 --> 00:04:15.400
NERV is falling apart.

00:04:15.400 --> 00:04:17.920
I'm afraid I don't know our future.

00:04:17.920 --> 00:04:22.460
I guess we'll have to wait for the instrumentalization project to start.

00:04:22.460 --> 00:04:29.600
I believe we are a set of hopeless, defective beings.

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:35.160
The Human Instrumentalization Project wants humanity to evolve artificially in a single perfect way.

00:04:35.160 --> 00:04:40.080
A kind of paradise on Earth that the Committee wants to realize.

00:04:40.080 --> 00:04:42.070
Kaji was right.

00:04:42.070 --> 00:04:44.480
It didn't matter if it was Adan or NERV.

00:04:44.480 --> 00:04:46.440
Only the Evas were on the plan.

00:04:46.440 --> 00:04:48.720
The date that was promised has arrived.

00:04:48.720 --> 00:04:54.320
With the lost Longinus Spear, Lilith will not be able to carry out our Instrumentalization.

00:04:54.320 --> 00:04:58.940
Our hopes fall on Unit 01, the only counterpart of Lilith.

00:04:58.940 --> 00:05:00.000
That's not part of the plan.

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:04.290
plan that has contemplated the humanity must be the bridge for the

00:05:04.290 --> 00:05:10.430
birth of the evas humanity must advance to the new world the evas

00:05:10.430 --> 00:05:15.070
they will make that possible we do not need to abandon our human form

00:05:15.070 --> 00:05:20.630
to climb the ark of eva is a necessary ritual for a species

00:05:20.630 --> 00:05:24.680
lost to be born again the fate of extinction is also the

00:05:24.680 --> 00:05:30.000
drive to a new world let's kill god to man to all species and let's be

00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:38.910
a single being. Death does not solve anything. Death must reach all of you.

00:05:38.910 --> 00:05:43.850
The human condition consists of how to deal with our survival. Maybe that's why

00:05:43.850 --> 00:05:46.640
she decided to stay inside the EVA.

00:06:50.160 --> 00:06:54.640
I see. So this is what happened in the second impact.

00:06:54.640 --> 00:06:56.400
They found me!

00:07:00.280 --> 00:07:01.280
No, it's not like that.

00:07:01.280 --> 00:07:05.530
Something else is happening.

00:07:08.910 --> 00:07:13.760
Change to the blue emergency command. You can obtain a satellite link.

00:07:13.760 --> 00:07:15.590
How is the right channel?

00:07:15.590 --> 00:07:18.590
All external communication networks are disabled.

00:07:18.590 --> 00:07:21.630
What is Maggi's status?

00:07:21.630 --> 00:07:27.010
We have intrusive data in all the external terminals. They are trying to hack Maggi.

00:07:27.010 --> 00:07:30.000
As I assumed. The culprit is Maggi 2 of Maggi.

00:07:30.000 --> 00:07:34.700
Matsushiro no five systems of Maggie attack us the responsible come from

00:07:34.700 --> 00:07:40.230
Germany China and the United States must organize all this we are five

00:07:40.230 --> 00:07:44.530
against one we are at a disadvantage

00:07:44.530 --> 00:07:48.630
disconnect the main database it seems that the hacking is

00:07:48.630 --> 00:07:52.610
imminent the external blocks are affected we cannot disconnect the

00:07:52.610 --> 00:07:58.800
circuits can not be if they take over from Maggie the entire headquarters will be theirs

00:08:08.960 --> 00:08:12.640
Do you want me to activate the Autonomous Defense System?

00:08:12.640 --> 00:08:16.880
That's right. Lieutenant Ibuki of the Secondary Command Center will assist you.

00:08:16.880 --> 00:08:20.580
Do you want me to return now that you need me after you expelled me?

00:08:20.580 --> 00:08:23.570
How selfish.

00:08:24.070 --> 00:08:28.130
Give me the report!

00:08:28.130 --> 00:08:30.000
Good morning, Major. Tokyo-2.

00:08:30.160 --> 00:08:32.160
The order A-801 has been declared.

00:08:32.160 --> 00:08:33.840
A-801?

00:08:33.840 --> 00:08:37.840
It's a term of the NERV protection law, under the jurisdiction of Japan.

00:08:37.840 --> 00:08:39.340
It's in the regulation.

00:08:40.840 --> 00:08:42.160
It's an ultimatum.

00:08:42.560 --> 00:08:44.110
It can't be anything else.

00:08:44.110 --> 00:08:45.610
Maggie is being hacked.

00:08:45.610 --> 00:08:47.570
It's Selly's main objective.

00:08:47.570 --> 00:08:48.880
It's the Buki.

00:08:48.880 --> 00:08:51.880
Dr. Akagi is in charge of covering up Maggie's defenses.

00:08:56.050 --> 00:08:56.690
Ritsuko?

00:09:07.000 --> 00:09:20.190
"The interaction between man and woman doesn't make any sense. Isn't that right, mother?"

00:09:20.190 --> 00:09:25.690
"How much more?"

00:09:25.690 --> 00:09:29.540
"Maybe we'll make it. Dr. Akagi is a genius."

00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:35.220
"I don't think they just want to hack Maggy, they're looking for something else, they want it all."

00:09:35.220 --> 00:09:43.190
"The attack on Maggy is the beginning, they want to take over the Docevas and if they do, the entire headquarters will be theirs."

00:09:43.190 --> 00:09:47.390
"Oh, that's right, they know we have Lily, Ciara."

00:09:47.390 --> 00:09:50.880
"I didn't imagine they'd be so desperate."

00:09:52.660 --> 00:09:59.940
"The hacking of Maggy has been interrupted, the type B shield has been executed, we are safe for the next few days."

00:10:00.000 --> 00:10:09.540
Next 62 hours.

00:10:09.540 --> 00:10:11.790
See you later, mother.

00:10:11.790 --> 00:10:15.790
Ikari has executed the code 666 to protect Amagi.

00:10:15.790 --> 00:10:18.840
Now it will be difficult to corrupt his system.

00:10:18.840 --> 00:10:21.830
We will have to suspend our cyber attack.

00:10:21.830 --> 00:10:24.780
Apparently we have no other option, we cannot be condescending.

00:10:24.780 --> 00:10:29.780
We will carry out a direct attack and occupy the headquarters by force.

00:10:39.500 --> 00:10:41.620
The time has come, to your positions.

00:11:20.800 --> 00:11:25.640
as you can imagine our last enemy is the man that all the staff

00:11:25.640 --> 00:11:29.160
go to the combat stations level 1 combat stations

00:11:30.160 --> 00:11:35.190
but they are not angels they are like us they do not see us as their

00:11:35.190 --> 00:11:37.650
equals

00:12:00.030 --> 00:12:02.080
-What's going on? Answer me! -What's going on?

00:12:02.080 --> 00:12:05.840
It's the southern station!

00:12:05.840 --> 00:12:22.400
What's going on?

00:12:22.400 --> 00:12:25.750
This building is just a distraction.

00:12:25.750 --> 00:12:28.760
If their goal is to take over the EVAs, they will surely go after the pilots.

00:12:28.760 --> 00:12:30.000
Refuge in Shinji in Unit 3.

00:12:30.000 --> 00:12:31.100
Hurry up!

00:12:31.100 --> 00:12:31.820
Yes.

00:12:31.820 --> 00:12:32.610
Where is Asuka?

00:12:32.610 --> 00:12:34.610
She's in room 303 of the hospital.

00:12:34.610 --> 00:12:37.280
Go after her and protect her in unit 02.

00:12:37.280 --> 00:12:40.780
But remember that you can't synchronize with the EVA.

00:12:40.780 --> 00:12:42.670
We'll keep her safe there.

00:12:42.670 --> 00:12:45.630
The safest place we have is inside an EVA.

00:12:45.630 --> 00:12:46.650
Understood.

00:12:46.650 --> 00:12:47.780
Interrupt the med...

00:12:47.780 --> 00:12:50.780
Once Asuka is safe, hide her in the underground lake.

00:12:50.780 --> 00:12:53.720
Maybe they'll find her, but it's better than the cage.

00:12:53.720 --> 00:12:54.820
And Rey?

00:12:54.820 --> 00:12:56.820
Her whereabouts are unknown, we can't find her.

00:12:56.820 --> 00:13:00.000
If they can't find her, they'll find her.

00:13:00.160 --> 00:13:18.990
They will kill you.

00:13:18.990 --> 00:13:22.850
Liberating unit 02, use route 8, place it at 70 meters.

00:13:22.850 --> 00:13:26.550
Then release unit 01, it must be inside the geofront.

00:13:26.550 --> 00:13:29.220
Impossible, we do not locate the pilot.

00:13:35.760 --> 00:13:44.520
Blocked. All non-combatants must evacuate via exit 87.

00:13:44.520 --> 00:13:48.900
Subterranean defense 3 has been penetrated. The enemy is at level 2.

00:13:48.900 --> 00:13:54.850
This is the special division of the FD. They will not take long to invade us.

00:13:54.850 --> 00:13:58.530
Professor Fuyutsuki, take care of the situation.

00:13:58.530 --> 00:13:59.830
Understood, sir.

00:14:00.120 --> 00:14:01.920
Send my regards to Yuy.

00:14:30.480 --> 00:14:35.040
the magnetic ring 52 has been destroyed they have no mercy the angels

00:14:35.040 --> 00:14:39.380
they seem noble it was to be expected our staff is not used to

00:14:39.380 --> 00:14:41.930
kill human beings

00:14:44.260 --> 00:15:00.000
they are destroying the red cables

00:15:00.220 --> 00:15:03.220
We have reached level 3! We can't go with them!

00:15:03.220 --> 00:15:06.220
Block F and the deviation tunnel are attacked by two fronts!

00:15:06.220 --> 00:15:08.330
Abandon all floors now!

00:15:08.330 --> 00:15:10.330
Retreat the combat units!

00:15:10.330 --> 00:15:14.330
Release the Vakelite in the corridors and in the exchange pipe in sector 803!

00:15:14.330 --> 00:15:15.330
Yes!

00:15:15.330 --> 00:15:25.000
Releasing the Vakelite from sector 803 will not stop them for a moment.

00:15:25.000 --> 00:15:29.980
Major Katsuragi, Route 47 is destroyed, group 3 is destroyed!

00:15:30.540 --> 00:15:38.800
You will not be able to rescue Shinji.

00:15:38.800 --> 00:15:42.640
The non-combatants must avoid facing these people.

00:15:42.640 --> 00:15:48.010
We are at a disadvantage. Those who cannot escape must surrender.

00:15:48.830 --> 00:15:50.830
Please take care of the situation.

00:15:50.830 --> 00:15:51.830
Yes.

00:15:54.340 --> 00:15:58.670
Understood. Do not take hostages. Fire at will.

00:16:00.570 --> 00:16:06.570
We have everything against us, this place has no capable soldiers, no one is going to be able to defend us.

00:16:06.570 --> 00:16:08.460
This is the best we have.

00:16:08.460 --> 00:16:12.460
If the FDS proposes, this place could be destroyed at any time.

00:16:12.460 --> 00:16:18.340
I'm sure that's why our budget for the prevention of intruders was withdrawn.

00:16:18.340 --> 00:16:20.640
I can't believe it.

00:16:32.140 --> 00:16:33.740
Take off the insurance

00:16:33.740 --> 00:16:38.680
I would never dare to do this

00:16:38.680 --> 00:16:40.900
You have already practiced before, Maya

00:16:40.900 --> 00:16:45.000
But-

00:16:45.000 --> 00:16:46.740
No! You will die if you don't do it

00:17:02.810 --> 00:17:12.610
King, I thought you would be here.

00:17:12.610 --> 00:17:23.400
The time has come. Come with me.

00:17:23.400 --> 00:17:27.560
Level 2 is invaded. Change.

00:17:32.300 --> 00:17:34.600
Located in the lower level's western room.

00:17:34.640 --> 00:17:37.100
Begin cooling cycle in Volscia 5.

00:17:37.140 --> 00:17:38.230
Quick!

00:17:40.020 --> 00:17:58.520
We found the pilot, neutralizing the target.

00:18:01.150 --> 00:18:03.150
Listen kid, this is not personal.

00:18:11.910 --> 00:18:18.060
This is not personal.

00:18:18.060 --> 00:18:21.250
Come on, you have to enter unit 01.

00:18:33.960 --> 00:18:38.320
We're in trouble. Now they want to prevent Shinji from going up to EVA.

00:18:38.320 --> 00:18:41.950
We can't waste any more time.

00:18:41.950 --> 00:18:43.370
We have to hurry.

00:18:43.370 --> 00:18:51.260
Shinji, decide if you want to go up, or are you willing to pilot Unit 01?

00:18:51.260 --> 00:18:54.570
If you stay here, you will surely die!

00:18:54.570 --> 00:18:57.430
Help me, Asuka. Please help me.

00:18:57.430 --> 00:19:00.000
Ask a girl to help you escape.

00:19:00.000 --> 00:19:05.040
You're the most immature thing you've ever done in your life, Shinji!

00:19:05.040 --> 00:19:07.850
Let's go! Get up!

00:19:07.850 --> 00:19:09.860
I order you!

00:19:09.860 --> 00:19:12.390
I don't want anything anymore. Let me die.

00:19:12.390 --> 00:19:13.990
I don't want to do anything.

00:19:13.990 --> 00:19:16.470
Stop crying! We don't have time!

00:19:16.470 --> 00:19:18.470
Value your life, damn it!

00:19:18.470 --> 00:19:24.760
Face it now! And then you can die!

00:19:24.760 --> 00:19:29.640
Forget this place. The number one priority is to secure the Dogma Terminal.

00:19:32.970 --> 00:19:37.330
They have destroyed everything, but I don't understand why they don't kill us.

00:19:37.330 --> 00:19:42.230
Don't doubt that's what they want, but they don't want to shoot Magi by accident.

00:19:42.230 --> 00:19:45.240
They want to seize him with the least possible damage.

00:19:45.240 --> 00:19:49.390
Even so, we have many biochemical weapons. Anyway, we are ruined.

00:19:49.390 --> 00:19:51.220
Will they use the N2 mines?

00:20:15.260 --> 00:20:17.760
Don't you know that this place is bombproof?

00:20:17.760 --> 00:20:19.840
Hm, they're desperate.

00:20:30.000 --> 00:20:35.530
to cause the third impact with the series of evas instead of the angels the

00:20:35.530 --> 00:20:40.510
second impact was intentionally caused by humans they tried

00:20:40.510 --> 00:20:44.660
go back to dan and turn him into a embryo again before the other

00:20:44.660 --> 00:20:50.630
angels woke him up in the end they just tried to minimize the disaster

00:20:50.630 --> 00:20:55.720
what I'm going to tell you is classified information

00:20:55.720 --> 00:21:00.000
we were born from the source of life or from lilith we are the number one angel

00:21:00.000 --> 00:21:06.750
Number 18, the other angels were another version of what we could have been.

00:21:06.750 --> 00:21:11.900
Just like us, they were humans, but sadly we can't coexist.

00:21:11.900 --> 00:21:15.100
There's no way.

00:21:15.100 --> 00:21:19.390
Shinji, that's why you need to eradicate the whole series of Evas.

00:21:19.390 --> 00:21:22.910
Only then can we survive.

00:21:22.910 --> 00:21:25.890
Are the phones not working?

00:21:25.890 --> 00:21:30.000
Yes, the missile impact was confirmed three minutes ago.

00:21:30.000 --> 00:21:34.160
was developing on its own the project of human instrumentation.

00:21:34.160 --> 00:21:38.570
They seek to provoke the third impact to eradicate

00:21:38.570 --> 00:21:40.470
all of humanity.

00:21:40.470 --> 00:21:44.690
The human being is the only species that is capable of hurting in that way.

00:21:44.690 --> 00:21:46.520
And now?

00:21:46.520 --> 00:21:50.160
What is going to happen with the NERV facilities?

00:21:50.160 --> 00:21:53.350
Do you want the Germans and the Chinese to develop that technology again?

00:21:53.350 --> 00:21:55.120
They will make the same mistake.

00:21:55.120 --> 00:21:58.280
We must disappear for 20 years.

00:21:58.280 --> 00:22:00.000
Just like the old Tokyo.

00:22:09.790 --> 00:22:12.790
We have conquered level 3 of the Dogma and the purple robot.

00:22:12.790 --> 00:22:15.230
What do you tell me about the red one?

00:22:15.230 --> 00:22:20.070
The reports indicate that it is in the underground lake. The pilot's whereabouts are unknown.

00:22:32.360 --> 00:22:33.520
The Four Great Mountains?

00:23:01.150 --> 00:23:01.640
Ha, ha, ha.

00:23:42.090 --> 00:23:51.530
The time has come for you to die with me.

00:23:51.530 --> 00:23:53.040
I don't want to.

00:23:53.040 --> 00:23:58.290
Don't kill her, live a little longer.

00:25:00.250 --> 00:25:01.250
I finally get it.

00:25:02.820 --> 00:25:05.480
I know what the spit means!

00:25:05.480 --> 00:25:09.600
You were protecting me!

00:25:30.760 --> 00:25:32.660
Tia Paz, you were by my side!

00:25:32.660 --> 00:25:39.670
She's activated! Asuka, stay alive!

00:25:39.670 --> 00:25:41.140
Asuka!

00:25:41.140 --> 00:25:50.330
The power source is the cable! Concentrate all the attack in that place!

00:25:50.330 --> 00:25:57.330
It doesn't matter that it's not connected to the umbilical cable!

00:26:39.660 --> 00:26:41.660
How do the Evas rebel again?

00:26:41.660 --> 00:26:44.800
How dare they confront us?

00:26:44.800 --> 00:26:49.620
Let's use the same force to counterattack.

00:27:19.420 --> 00:27:22.530
Are you done with the Eva series?

00:27:30.000 --> 00:27:38.960
They released new Evas with the engine S2, there are nine, this mission is practically impossible, what happens, do they plan to release them all?

00:28:00.220 --> 00:28:07.970
to defeat the Eva series. Shinji is already on the way, resist. Hey, can we use route 20

00:28:07.970 --> 00:28:14.260
for the launch of unit 01? Yes, I am preparing cage 7, it will be ready in three minutes,

00:28:14.260 --> 00:28:16.360
I will try to hurry as much as I can.

00:28:31.150 --> 00:28:33.180
Do I have to kill them all?

00:28:33.180 --> 00:28:37.360
They're asking too much of a girl who got out of a coma.

00:28:37.360 --> 00:28:40.440
I have three and a half minutes left.

00:28:40.440 --> 00:28:43.610
To defeat the 9, 20 seconds each.

00:29:13.050 --> 00:29:23.560
-Come here. -There they are!

00:29:23.880 --> 00:29:26.790
We couldn't neutralize them. Shall we chase them, sir?

00:29:27.230 --> 00:29:30.000
Negative. We'll destroy the whole area.

00:29:30.380 --> 00:29:32.760
-It's time to evacuate. -Understood.

00:29:32.760 --> 00:29:38.180
With this, we will gain some time.

00:29:38.180 --> 00:29:47.870
I'm fine. It's not as bad as it seems.

00:29:47.870 --> 00:29:55.640
There is still energy. You will make it.

00:30:02.240 --> 00:30:09.020
Listen to me, Shinji, from now on you will be alone, you will not be able to receive any kind of help.

00:30:09.020 --> 00:30:30.000
No, I can't, I'm worthless, I don't deserve to be the pilot of that Eva, I have hurt many people, I am a murderer, I thought I should be the pilot of that Eva, but I was just deceiving myself.

00:30:30.890 --> 00:30:36.690
I'm not able to understand anything, I don't deserve to be a pilot of EVA, I can't do anything to help others!

00:30:36.690 --> 00:30:42.340
I did terrible things to Asuka, I even killed Kaoru!

00:30:42.340 --> 00:30:50.930
I don't have kindness in my heart, I'm a fraud, a coward, I'm just good at hurting people, that's why I shouldn't do anything!

00:30:50.930 --> 00:30:56.690
Don't think I sympathize with you, if you really want to avoid being hurt, then don't do anything and die!

00:30:56.690 --> 00:31:00.000
Crying won't help us at all!

00:31:00.250 --> 00:31:11.480
That's why you hurt others. When you hurt someone, you put that pain inside of you.

00:31:11.480 --> 00:31:15.960
That pain is superior to when they hurt you. But it doesn't matter what happens.

00:31:15.960 --> 00:31:20.960
Everything depends on you. This has a purpose. But that can only arise from yourself.

00:31:20.960 --> 00:31:24.950
Don't distance yourself. Think about what you can do.

00:31:24.950 --> 00:31:30.000
Fix what you have to fix. But do something now, Shinji.

00:31:30.220 --> 00:31:34.380
You are a stranger to me. How dare you believe that you already know me?

00:31:36.060 --> 00:31:38.060
And what if I'm a stranger?

00:31:38.290 --> 00:31:40.430
Do you want to give up so easily?

00:31:40.960 --> 00:31:46.960
After everything that happened, if you decide to paralyze yourself now, believe me, I will not forgive you.

00:31:47.360 --> 00:31:54.570
I will hate you until I die. You are not the center of everything. You will realize that and then you will regret it.

00:31:55.170 --> 00:32:00.000
I also went through that. I lived a false joy and I hated myself.

00:32:00.030 --> 00:32:06.130
to myself but I managed to overcome it step by step why are you here Shinji

00:32:06.130 --> 00:32:11.450
what is your destiny in this world you have to discover your answers no

00:32:11.450 --> 00:32:23.110
matter that you face the pain do it now and once you do it please

00:32:31.560 --> 00:32:32.720
Promise me, please.

00:32:35.440 --> 00:32:54.640
It was a kiss from adults.

00:32:54.640 --> 00:32:57.430
When you come back, we'll do the rest.

00:33:15.550 --> 00:33:23.240
I should have put a in this place, right?

00:33:30.000 --> 00:33:50.930
I did the right thing.

00:35:36.400 --> 00:35:38.160
I've been waiting for you, Gendo.

00:36:17.920 --> 00:36:24.580
I'm sorry, but Maggy's configuration has been manipulated. I did it!

