Am I dead? No. It is the only place where we are all one. This is what you always wanted.

01:17:07.320 --> 01:17:10.850
I don't want a place like this.

01:17:10.850 --> 01:17:14.280
If you want the others to return to life,

01:17:14.280 --> 01:17:17.190
then the inner walls will return.

01:17:17.190 --> 01:17:21.350
Everyone will be separated and the fear of being hurt will return.

01:17:21.350 --> 01:17:23.680
I understand.

01:17:31.880 --> 01:17:56.880
Thank you very much, it seems that only the negative happens in this place, probably that's why I always wanted to escape, but that's no use at all, because then I'm not there anymore, it's the same, nobody exists.

01:17:56.880 --> 01:17:59.570
Are you sure you want to...

01:18:00.000 --> 01:18:02.560
That people get hurt with their AT shields?

01:18:02.560 --> 01:18:08.750
I think it's... the best, but who's inside me?

01:18:08.750 --> 01:18:15.480
Hope. Hope is what serves to unite with others.

01:18:15.480 --> 01:18:18.080
All united by the power of love.

01:18:18.080 --> 01:18:30.000
But it's just a facade. My conclusions are weak, just like the prayers. I will be betrayed. Sooner or later they will abandon me.

01:18:31.660 --> 01:18:37.430
But I think that I want to meet everyone again.

01:18:37.430 --> 01:18:41.170
My feeling is sincere.

01:19:48.520 --> 01:19:50.660
Dreams live inside reality.

01:19:51.670 --> 01:19:53.670
And the truth is inside our hearts.

01:19:55.140 --> 01:19:58.530
The human heart gives us the shape we have.

01:20:01.500 --> 01:20:06.500
But if you see beyond, you can change the shape of hearts and bodies.

01:20:06.500 --> 01:20:13.040
The visions, the power to imagine, build the future of people.

01:20:13.040 --> 01:20:16.980
And the flow of time is something you can always do.

01:20:16.980 --> 01:20:22.830
But humanity will not change unless it uses its own initiative.

01:20:22.830 --> 01:20:26.710
That's why you must claim your lost being with your own effort.

01:20:26.710 --> 01:20:30.000
No matter what you lose your own lives.

01:20:31.180 --> 01:20:34.290
It doesn't matter that the words of others define you.

01:20:34.290 --> 01:20:59.770
Imagine your own image.

01:21:00.890 --> 01:21:02.890
can create its own form.

01:21:02.890 --> 01:21:12.570
Don't worry.

01:21:12.570 --> 01:21:15.070
There is an engine in every living being

01:21:15.070 --> 01:21:17.070
that tries to restore everything.

01:21:17.070 --> 01:21:19.050
There is a heart

01:21:19.050 --> 01:21:21.050
that struggles to move forward.

01:21:21.050 --> 01:21:24.170
As long as there is the desire to live,

01:21:24.170 --> 01:21:27.360
any place will be a paradise.

01:21:30.730 --> 01:21:53.110
When you are alive, the opportunities to be happy are everywhere, while there is the sun, the moon and the earth, everything will make sense.

01:22:17.820 --> 01:22:19.040
Are you going to be okay?

01:22:19.040 --> 01:22:26.520
I don't know where I can find happiness.

01:22:26.520 --> 01:22:29.220
I'll stay here and keep thinking

01:22:30.250 --> 01:22:39.680
I will be born soon, and I will analyze my life, since I will realize everything over and over again.

01:22:39.680 --> 01:22:43.430
There will only be what I have always been.

01:22:43.430 --> 01:22:55.830
What will you do, mother? Will you be okay?

01:22:55.830 --> 01:23:00.000
The man built the "Eva", the image of God.

01:23:00.000 --> 01:23:05.110
our true purpose if only humanity can inhabit this

01:23:05.110 --> 01:23:11.410
planet but it elevates lives forever thanks to the hearts of the

01:23:11.410 --> 01:23:15.600
people who are inside of him no matter what happens in five

01:23:15.600 --> 01:23:20.020
million years even if the earth the sun and the moon

01:23:20.020 --> 01:23:30.000
disappear it elevates will remain forever even if you are alone you will live this is the

01:23:30.000 --> 01:23:34.430
This is the proof that we humans will live forever.

01:23:34.430 --> 01:23:37.400
Goodbye, Mother.

01:26:25.980 --> 01:26:26.560
It is.
